OL,3,GNEWSAFarm shop says roadworks hurting
OL,4,Afestive business
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Kent farm shop which has been
OL,7,Foperating for more than 50 years says
OL,8,Fits festive trade has been affected by
OL,9,Fpersistent roadworks.
OL,11,FGrange Road Farm Shop in Gillingham
OL,12,Fclaimed the latest scheduled roadworks
OL,13,Fis hampering its business.
OL,15,FThe scheme involves replacing an ageing
OL,16,Fgas main in Lower Rainham Road with a
OL,17,Fplastic pipe to reduce leaks and
OL,18,Fimprove reliability.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
