OL,3,GNEWSAFarm shop says roadworks hurting
OL,4,Afestive business
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the gas distribution
OL,7,Fcompany SGN said the works were
OL,8,F"essential" to ensure it could continue
OL,9,Fto provide homes and businesses with a
OL,10,Fsafe and reliable gas supply.
